Scope

This license covers the source code, tools, build scripts and documentation
written for this repository. It does not cover, and grants no rights to:

- Assassin's Creed or any other original game files (executables, DLLs such
  as binkw32.dll, archives, videos, audio, saves). Users supply their own
  legally obtained copy.
- Code generated from the original game executables by the tools in this
  repository (translated game functions, catalogs and reports under work/),
  which remains derived from the original copyrighted program.

Third-party components keep their own licenses and notices, for example:
src/runtime/LICENSE.pcrecomp.txt (pcrecomp, MIT),
src/runtime/LICENSE.recomp-kit.txt (recomp-kit, MIT), src/runtime/NOTICE.md
(including FFmpeg, LGPL-2.1-or-later, used through ports/ffmpeg), and the
notices of DXVK and other dependencies under third_party/ and ports/.
